        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand mb-1 uppercase">Step 4</div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-navy">Instant Contact</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The emergency profile opens in under 3 seconds. They call directly. Your WhatsApp gets the location alert.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-8">
      <a href="/demo" class="btn-brand">See the Emergency Page Live →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

